      "heading": "Transaction History Analysis",
      "id": "transaction-history",
      "intro": "Transaction History menampilkan riwayat transaksi cardholder untuk analisis pattern dan behavior. Membantu determine apakah transaksi suspicious atau normal.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Akses Transaction History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka alert detail\n• Pilih tab **Transaction History**\n• Otomatis load transaksi cardholder last 30 days\n• Data ditampilkan dalam tabel chronological\n• Transaksi yang trigger alert akan ter-highlight",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eff6ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Transaction History</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">Last 30 days</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;\">Analyzing cardholder transaction pattern</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "View Transaction List",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel menampilkan kolom:\n  - Date/Time\n  - Amount\n  - Merchant Name & Category\n  - Transaction Type\n  - Status (Approved/Declined)\n  - Location\n• Sort by kolom (click header)\n• Current transaction ter-highlight dengan border khusus",
